  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Regional Programme to increase women&apos;s access to reproductive health services in sub-Saharan Africa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Regional Programme to increase women&apos;s access to reproductive health services in sub-Saharan Africa is a component of Regional Programme to increase women&apos;s access to reproductive health services in sub-Saharan Africa reported by FCDO with a funding type of 111 - Not for profit organisation and a budget of &#xa3;12,452,220. This project benefits Africa, regional. It works in the following sector(s): Reproductive health care, Medical research.</narrative>
  </description>
